R-EC2 R-CM21 R-RG9 R-YK3 R-AP27 R-TP2 R-FL5 (slice 249, Q629-1 follows the recommendation): each stop sends no request: the calls of each run end after the read of config.toml. The order, as R-PUB4 item 1: direct (exit 2) before --offline (exit 15) before the operand (exit 2) before GITHUB_REPOSITORY before the OIDC variables (the text names id-token: write). The run with an empty repository and an empty OIDC URL shows the repository first. No release route is in the case: no run reaches it.
